WEBVTT

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:02.680
Organizations face countless cybersecurity recommendations, standards, frameworks,

00:00:02.680 --> 00:00:03.786
and best practices.

00:00:03.786 --> 00:00:07.840
That volume can make it difficult to decide where to start.

00:00:07.840 --> 00:00:12.263
The CIS Controls were developed to help organizations focus on a prioritized

00:00:12.263 --> 00:00:16.317
set of defensive actions that reduce risk and improve security outcomes.

00:00:16.317 --> 00:00:19.266
Rather than trying to do everything at once,

00:00:19.266 --> 00:00:23.320
the controls help organizations concentrate on activities that provide meaningful value.

00:00:23.320 --> 00:00:25.900
For engineers, administrators, managers, and security professionals,

00:00:25.900 --> 00:00:31.060
the CIS Controls create a practical language for turning security goals into operational work.
